# Fuzz harness run artifacts (#377) — keep the dir (.gitkeep), ignore the runs.
# Commit a specific run only as PR evidence under docs/evidence/<issue>/.
docs/fuzz-runs/*
!docs/fuzz-runs/.gitkeep
